domain NarrationStoredStyleBoundary:
  description "Offline stored narration style validation repair"
problem P1:
  |
    Preserve valid narration confirmation and replay while rejecting corrupt stored styles.
evidence E1:
  |
    narration-style-assets-v2.ts activation completed replay and current style reads
    use JSON.parse and as NarrationStyle without schema validation.
evidence E2:
  |
    The offline regression writes instruction null to the isolated stored style.
    Before repair the completed replay does not reject and the assertion fails.
    Existing valid candidate and activation tests pass. No live database was used.
evidence E3:
  |
    NarrationStyleSchema is the shared boundary schema. Repository type escapes
    on repaired authoritative snapshot paths are forbidden by project guidance.
evidence E4:
  |
    A transport or model failure cannot explain returning this stored corrupt value:
    the completed branch reads SQLite without a model call. Historical introduction
    and prior review escape are unknown. Existing valid fixtures do not exercise corruption.
decision D1 based_on P1, E1, E2, E3, E4:
  |
    The demonstrated local producing condition is unchecked stored unknown data
    asserted as NarrationStyle. Corrupt storage is the trigger; valid-only fixtures
    and the assertion bypass explain the bounded detection gap, not historical causes.
decision D2 based_on D1, E3:
  |
    Validate both stored style reads with NarrationStyleSchema and reject invalid
    JSON or schema values before appending a generation. Preserve valid replay.
    Verify both rejection branches, unchanged generation pointer and restored valid replay.
